<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat edges down in dull session.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat edges down in dull session.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures traded quietly on Monday after Chicago's Friday decline due to fund selling.</p>
<p>SFE January 1997 contracts fell by A$1.50 to A$150.00 a tonne on a single trade.</p>
<p>Brokers said the market lacked interest.  </p>
